PART 7 — TRAIN ON YOUR OWN DATA IN SUPABASE
========================================

34. Supabase Data — What It Is

Your questions, facts and words live in Supabase, table "ored_training_data".
The 1003 questions from facts.yaml are already there (dataset tag "facts").

You add rows in Supabase
   ↓
you mark them verified = true
   ↓
you run ONE command
   ↓
Ored takes a fixed copy of the rows (a "snapshot")
   ↓
splits it: train / val / test (the same question never lands in two)
   ↓
trains
   ↓
best.pt / live.pt / history/ like before
   ↓
Supabase records which data made which checkpoint

Only rows with enabled = true AND verified = true are used.
Rows added while training runs are not used by that run.

Full details: ored\model\docs\training-data.md

